Day 48: Automating Infrastructure Deployment with AWS CloudFormation
📌 Overview

On Day 48, I worked with AWS CloudFormation to automate the deployment and management of AWS infrastructure using Infrastructure as Code (IaC).

Instead of creating AWS resources manually through the AWS Console, CloudFormation allows infrastructure to be defined in a YAML template and deployed as a stack.

